OL,3,AGisele Pelicot rape case to be told in
OL,4,ALondon play
OL,5,
OL,6,FA play telling the "harrowing" story of
OL,7,Fthe Gisele Pelicot rape case will be
OL,8,Fperformed in London at a one-off event
OL,9,Fat London County Hall, on the South
OL,10,FBank.
OL,12,FMs Pelicot's ex-husband, Dominique
OL,13,FPelicot, was jailed for 20 years for
OL,14,Fdrugging and raping her, as well as
OL,15,Fallowing other men to rape her while
OL,16,Fshe was unconscious, in abuse that
OL,17,Flasted nearly a decade.
OL,19,FThe 73-year-old, who waived her right
OL,20,Fto anonymity as a survivor of sexual
OL,21,Fabuse, said shame should fall on her
OL,22,Fabusers, not her.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
