OL,3,AGisele Pelicot rape case to be told in
OL,4,ALondon play
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty actors and public figures will
OL,7,Ftake part in the "documentary theatre"
OL,8,Fstyle performance, created from
OL,9,Fdocuments from the trial and
OL,10,Fpsychiatric reports of the 51 men who
OL,11,Fwere prosecuted.
